14	/**
15	 * Emits the audit trail for a newly created owner. Runs after {@link SaveOwner} has persisted
16	 * the entity, so the generated id is available. On the dedicated {@code AUDIT} logger it emits
17	 * both a human-readable line (owner id, assigned member id, effective registration date,
18	 * derived membership points and level) and an immutable structured
19	 * {@link OwnerCreatedEvent}, stamped with the next sequence number. Purely a side-effect step;
20	 * it leaves the owner unchanged for the responder.
