10	 * Enqueues the welcome notification for a newly created owner. Runs after {@link SaveOwner} has
11	 * persisted the entity and {@link AssignMemberId} has set the member id, so both the generated id
12	 * and the member id are available. On the dedicated {@code NOTIFY} logger it emits a single line
13	 * carrying the owner id and member id, the hand-off to whatever delivers the welcome message.
14	 * Purely a side-effect step; it leaves the owner unchanged for the responder.
